## 3. Caveats

1. **Target Port Conflicts**:
   Default port is `8088`. If another service is already bound to port 8088 on the host or TV, `test-poc-service.js` supports `--port=<port>` or detects existing services via `--external`.
2. **Upstream CDN Latency**:
   Stream resolution (Check 5) and manifest fetching (Check 6) perform real HTTPS requests against `api.wing.st` and `lightspeed.st`. Timeouts are set to 15,000ms to tolerate network latency.
3. **No Other Caveats**: All specifications have been empirically verified and tested on host Node 26 and physical TV Node 12.22.2.

