### 4.3 Specification 3: Drop-in IPK Verification Harness `poc/verify-ipk.js`

This script is located in the agent workspace at:
`/home/prem/webos-projects/cinejoy-webos/.agents/teamwork/orchestrator_poc/explorer_m1_3/verify-ipk.js`

